y copied %d files":["\u6210\u529f\u590d\u5236%d\u6587\u4ef6"],"Successfully copied one file":["\u6210\u529f\u590d\u5236\u4e00\u4e2a\u6587\u4ef6"],"Successfully created {{strong}}%s{{\/strong}}":["\u6210\u529f\u521b\u5efa\u4e86{{strong}}%s{{\/strong}}"],"Successfully deleted {{strong}}%d folders{{\/strong}}":["\u6210\u529f\u5220\u9664{{strong}}%d\u6587\u4ef6\u5939{{\/strong}}"],"Successfully deleted {{strong}}%s{{\/strong}}":["\u6210\u529f\u5220\u9664{{strong}}%s{{\/strong}}"],"Successfully moved %d files":["\u6210\u529f\u79fb\u52a8\u4e86%d\u6587\u4ef6"],"Successfully moved one file":["\u6210\u529f\u79fb\u52a8\u4e00\u4e2a\u6587\u4ef6"],"Successfully renamed folder to {{strong}}%s{{\/strong}}":["\u5df2\u6210\u529f\u5c06\u6587\u4ef6\u5939\u91cd\u547d\u540d\u4e3a{{strong}}%s{{\/strong}}"],"Successfully sorted the tree hierarchy":["\u6210\u529f\u6392\u5e8f\u6811\u5c42\u6b21\u7ed3\u6784"],"Thanks for using the free version of Real Media Library.":["\u611f\u8c22\u60a8\u4f7f\u7528Real Media Library\u7684\u514d\u8d39\u7248\u672c\u3002"],"The current selected folder has some restrictions:":["\u5f53\u524d\u9009\u62e9\u7684\u6587\u4ef6\u5939\u6709\u4e00\u4e9b\u9650\u5236:"],"The folder you try to delete has subfolders.":["\u8981\u5220\u9664\u7684\u6587\u4ef6\u5939\u6709\u5b50\u6587\u4ef6\u5939\u3002"],"Unorganized":["\u65e0\u7ec4\u7ec7\u7684"],"Want to create subfolders?":["\u5355\u51fb\u6b64\u4ee5\u521b\u5efa\u4e00\u4e2a\u65b0\u6587\u4ef6\u5939?"],"Want to switch between folders more comfortably?":[""],"Want to upload entire folders?":["\u5355\u51fb\u6b64\u4ee5\u521b\u5efa\u4e00\u4e2a\u65b0\u6587\u4ef6\u5939?"],"With Real Media Library you can upload entire folders using drag and drop. All folders, subfolders and files will be uploaded and displayed in your media library in the same structure. Get PRO to upload folders!":[""],"You cannot change {{strong}}parent{{\/strong}} folder":["\u60a8\u4e0d\u80fd\u66f4\u6539{{strong}}\u6bcd{{\/strong}}\u6587\u4ef6\u5939"],"You cannot {{strong}}create{{\/strong}} subfolders":["\u60a8\u4e0d\u80fd{{strong}}\u521b\u5efa{{\/strong}}\u5b50\u6587\u4ef6\u5939"],"You cannot {{strong}}delete{{\/strong}} the folder":[""],"You cannot {{strong}}insert{{\/strong}} new files. New files will be moved to Unorganized...":[""],"You cannot {{strong}}move{{\/strong}} files outside the folder":[""],"You cannot {{strong}}rearrange{{\/strong}} subfolders":[""],"You cannot {{strong}}rename{{\/strong}} the folder":["\u60a8\u4e0d\u80fd{{strong}}\u91cd\u547d\u540d{{\/strong}}\u6587\u4ef6\u5939"],"You like collections?":[""],"https:\/\/devowl.io\/knowledge-base\/license-installation-type\/":[""],"Could not reorder file.":[""],"In the current view of uploads, filters are active. Please reset them and refresh the view.":["\u5728\u4e0a\u4f20\u7684\u5f53\u524d\u89c6\u56fe\u4e2d\uff0c\u8fc7\u6ee4\u5668\u662f\u6d3b\u52a8\u7684\u3002\u8bf7\u91cd\u7f6e\u8fd9\u4e9b\u5e76\u5237\u65b0\u89c6\u56fe\u3002"],"No folder selected for reordering.":[""],"Note: If you want to delete a shortcut file, the source file will NOT be deleted.\nIf you want to delete a non-shortcut file, all associated shortcuts are deleted, too.":[""],"Please select a folder to show items.":["\u8bf7\u9009\u62e9\u4e00\u4e2a\u6587\u4ef6\u5939\u6765\u663e\u793a\u9879\u76ee\u3002"],"Real Media Library creates a virtual folder structure. The URLs of uploads do not change when you move the file. Learn more about <a href=\"https:\/\/devowl.io\/knowledge-base\/real-media-library-physical-folder-structur\/\" target=\"_blank\">how to automatically move files to physical folders.<\/a>":[""],"Shortcut":["\u5feb\u6377\u65b9\u5f0f"],"The file is uploaded to the folder where you are currently in.":["\u6587\u4ef6\u88ab\u4e0a\u4f20\u5230\u60a8\u5f53\u524d\u6240\u5728\u7684\u6587\u4ef6\u5939\u3002"],"This is a shortcut of a media library file. Shortcuts doesn't need any physical storage {{strong}}(0 kB){{\/strong}}. If you want to change the file itself, you must do this in the original file (for example replace media file through a plugin).\nNote also that the fields in the shortcuts can be different to the original file, for example \"Title\", \"Description\" or \"Caption\".":[""]}}}